<title>USA: ACNielsen Corp Q4 net per share is $0.20.</title>
<headline>ACNielsen Corp Q4 net per share is $0.20.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn. 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr profit	$0.20	 loss     $2.85</p>
<p> Net profit	11,400	loss     161,000</p>
<p> Revs		367,700		  348,900</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  56,800		   56,500</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit	$0.28	 loss     $4.09</p>
<p> Net profit	15,800	loss     230,900</p>
<p> Revs		1,358,600		1,281,300</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  56,700		   56,500</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Q4 1995 results include one-time charge of $152.2 million. Excluding the charge, Q4 results for that year were a net loss of $19.7 million, or $0.35 per share.</p>
<p>Full-year 1995 results include several one-time charges. Excluding them, the results would show a loss of $65.4 million, or $1.16 per share.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
